,"en":"A minister of Wei who rose to Minister of Oration. He once advised Sima Shi that Zhuge Ke was arrogant and overconfident and would not remain active for long, counseling against worry. Events indeed unfolded exactly as Zhang Ji had predicted. After the Sima family took power, he received secret orders from Cao Fang to assassinate Sima Shi alongside Li Feng, Xiahou Xuan, and others, but due to Sima Shi's vigilance, the plot was uncovered and he was executed.","jp":"魏の臣。官位は光禄大夫に至る。かつて司馬師に対し、諸葛恪はその才を恃んで傲慢であり、長く活躍することはないため憂慮するに及ばないと進言したが、後に張緝の推測通りとなった。司馬家族が執政を行うようになると、曹芳の密命を受けて李豊や夏侯玄らと共に司馬師の謀殺を図ったが、司馬師の警戒により露見し、処刑された。","kr":"위나라의 신하로, 관직은 광록대부에 이르렀습니다. 일찍이 사마사에게 제갈각이 자신의 재능만 믿고 오만하니 결코 오래가지 못할 것이므로 염려할 필요가 없다고 진언하였는데, 훗날 과연 장집이 예측한 대로 되었습니다. 사마 가문이 집권한 뒤에는 조방의 밀명을 받들어 이풍, 하후현 등과 함께 사마사를 시해하려 하였으나, 사마사의 의심과 경계로 인해 발각되어 처형당했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10430","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"缉","nameTc":"緝","nameEn":"Ji","nameJp":"緝","nameKr":"집","nameOther":"","word":"敬仲","wordTc":"敬仲","wordEn":"Jingzhong","wordJp":"敬仲","wordKr":"경중","wordOther":"","icon":"张缉","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"215","city":"CS1030","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"34","wise":"77","politics":"76","charm":"75","will":"65","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"2","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"9/9/9/9/9/76/23/9","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1015805","debateSoul":"1000201","warSoulPoint":"5100","battleSoulPoint":"1100","debateSoulPoint":"5900","strategy":"1004308","strategy2":"1001805","professions":"0/0/0/2/0/0